From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Baptiste Augrain <daiyam@zokugun.org>
Date: Sat, 1 Jan 2000 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: don't try to load the missing vsda signing library

vsda is Microsoft's proprietary signing native module and is not shipped in the open-source build, so probing for and loading it only ever fails. The remote server and web sign service stub the validator and signing paths to return null / throw instead of attempting to load the missing native or wasm library (#2613).

